<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Stinking Breath</h1>
<p>Sphere: Poison Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Necromancer (guild level 100)
Mana: 38
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast stinking breath &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast stinking breath</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster cups their hands before their mouth and utters 'Schwepa cumei 
entahc', and a foul cloud of breath engulfs the target. It is the 
strongest of the necromancers' poison clouds: the better your divine 
power and your poison sphere, the more it hurts. It is deadly against 
those in clothes or leather, weaker against chain, and does nothing at 
all to someone in plate. A shield is no use against it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
